        <mxCell id="n17" value="Arrows point DOWNWARD only. Identity is the foundation and depends on nobody.&lt;br&gt;Money depends only on Identity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Money must NOT point at Ordering. Ordering computes the amount and calls Money,&lt;br&gt;passing a reference like {type: order, id: 123}. To Money that reference is an&lt;br&gt;opaque string — it does not know what an order is. That is what makes Money the&lt;br&gt;easiest context to split into its own service later.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The rule is enforced by eslint-plugin-boundaries, not by convention. Current&lt;br&gt;debt: 29 legacy violations, allowed to shrink but never to grow." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#c8a415;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="760" width="660" height="155" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n18" value="Money — the protected core.&lt;br&gt;Every balance change goes through LedgerService.post()" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#c8a415;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="580" width="320" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
